        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by distance (850 km), truck size (18‑ft, 22‑ft, or 32‑ft containers), weight of goods, number of staircases, and any special services like white‑glove packing or expedited delivery. Seasonal demand and fuel surcharge may also affect the final tariff.</p>
